{"id":"otdelenie","lemma":"отделение","pos":"noun","rank":1751,"glosses":["department, division, branch","separation","secretion"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"отделения","plural":"отделения"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы направляемся в отделение полиции.","en":"We're going to the police station.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"police","l":"полиция"}]},{"text":"Это почтовое отделение, а это банк.","en":"This is a post office and that's a bank.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"mail","l":"почтовый"},null,{"g":"and / but"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"bank"}]},{"text":"Скажите мне, пожалуйста, как отсюда добраться до почтового отделения.","en":"Please tell me how to get to the post office from here.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"from here, hence"},{"g":"to get , to reach"},{"g":"until / before"},null,null]},{"text":"Скажите, где находится отделение милиции.","en":"Tell me where the police station is.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be found","l":"находиться"},null,null]},{"text":"Почтовое отделение не очень далеко отсюда.","en":"The post office isn't too far from here.","words":[{"g":"mail","l":"почтовый"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"far off"},{"g":"from here, hence"}]}]}